# Design first

Before any work in this repository, read `docs/DESIGN.md` in full, then `docs/HANDOVER.md`. Follow the design. Update `docs/DESIGN.md` in the same PR as any change to behavior, schema, UI copy, APIs, settings, or wrangler config. Update `docs/HANDOVER.md` in the same PR when wrangler config, migrations, deploy scripts, routines-related docs, env/bindings, current state, or pending decisions change. `npm test` runs `scripts/check-design.mjs`, which fails the change if those docs are missing.

Hard safety rules:

- Do not place, cancel, or modify a real Robinhood order without the owner's explicit confirmation of that specific order.
- Leave `ALLOW_LIVE_TRADING` at `"0"` unless the owner clearly says to turn it on.
- Keep dev and prod separate (Workers, D1, R2, Access, tokens). Dev should not hold a live Robinhood token.
- Do not deploy to prod or change prod without the owner's explicit go-ahead.
- Mask account numbers to the last four characters everywhere.

The same rules are in `AGENTS.md`.
